sequenceDiagram
  participant GH as GitHub
  participant API as Webhook API
  participant Q as Queue
  participant W as Worker
  participant DB as Database
  GH->>API: Repository event
  API->>API: Validate signature + deduplicate
  API->>Q: Enqueue
  API-->>GH: Acknowledge
  Q->>W: Deliver event
  W->>GH: Fetch allowed evidence
  GH-->>W: Commit/diff/files
  W->>DB: Store evidence and verification result
  W->>DB: Update qualifying progress event
